From ce6c8e651a1ebb33e23d912044d69d90caa5a40c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OreoYang <oreo.yang@vecima.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:01:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] validation FEATURE incremental validation driven by an edit diff

Validating a whole module after every edit is quadratic in the size of the
datastore, which dominates the cost of provisioning thousands of instances.

Add lyd_validate_module_incr(): every when/must/leafref/unique constraint is
classified by how far its dependencies reach (local, list-scope, bounded,
unbounded) and cached per context. Given a diff that describes every change
since the data were last valid, only the subtrees the diff can invalidate are
revalidated. Whatever cannot be reduced to a finite set of paths falls back to
full validation, so the verdict always equals validating the whole module. A
late fallback is taken when validation itself deletes a node. Counters are
exposed by lyd_validate_incr_stats() and lyd_validate_incr_late_stats().

Later fixes in this series: dependency index rebuilt after schema changes,
default nodes appearing in untouched list instances, mandatory/min-elements
nodes behind a remote when, relative negation/count/arithmetic reading sibling
instances, deep delete chains, and shallow scope for list deletes
(LYD_VALIDATE_INCR_SHALLOW_DELETE). Differential unit tests compare every case
against full validation.

Squash of Oreo/incremental-stale-index-3.9.13 (ce6c8e651) on the product base
efe43e379082 (Yocto libyang_3.13.5). Commits:
  496d4864b validation FEATURE incremental validation driven by an edit diff
  b80bb3aec validation FEATURE skip value-keyed uniqueness-count musts
  cc0780a43 validation BUGFIX incremental validation misses
  c02e70bc1 validation BUGFIX do not trust create on implicit defaults
  13320e991 validation BUGFIX harden incremental validation corners
  af470a99b validation BUGFIX arithmetic reads the first node of a node-set
  3f1c70846 validation BUGFIX rebuild stale incremental dependency indexes
  2ef4aba30 validation BUGFIX fall back when a default may appear in untouched instances
  60d8871b5 validation FEATURE shallow scope for list deletes, rules reading whole containers
  380f162fb validation BUGFIX relative negation or count leaving the list instance
  cc2b2c822 validation OPTIMIZE avoid quadratic set dedup in incremental validation
  800f68a45 validation FEATURE gap-shape tests for production rule coverage
  f3b6af6a5 validation BUGFIX recheck absent mandatory nodes after remote when flips
  325e5cafa validation FEATURE exact-shape tests for cross-module when, absolute leafref and value-keyed must
  32c6990be validation BUGFIX shallow delete through LOCAL rules with empty atoms
  39cbdc60c validation FEATURE structural constraint rows and misc schema checks in incr UT
  ce6c8e651 validation: cover key changes in incremental tests
